  <part id="P1">
    <!--
      Synthetic. Measure 1: slurs placed below beamed stem-down groups (32nds and eighths), the beam under the noteheads
      (the shape of Paisiello's Nel cor piu non mi sento, Schirmer edition, piano m2). Measure 2: a lower voice of two
      beamed stem-down eighths with a slur below, under an upper voice (A. Scarlatti's O cessate di piagarmi, Schirmer edition, piano m5).
      The slurs start and end at the stem tips, just under the beam.
    -->
